{"change_summary":"Inspected the latest approved review feedback for the save-schema migration work and made no additional code changes. The remaining review notes were unrelated branch-level follow-ups or accepted design choices rather than actionable defects in the migration implementation, so I left `crates/tank_core/src/save.rs`, `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs`, and `crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs` unchanged and reran the focused validation.","outstanding_risks":["Known unrelated branch regression carried forward from prior review: `cargo test -p tank_core --test shrimp_population hatch_produces_juveniles -- --exact` was previously failing on this branch with TAN around 2.169 mg/L and no juvenile hatch; this apply-fixes pass did not address or revalidate it.","Known unrelated architectural issue carried forward from prior review: `Engine::step_hours` still calls `enforce_invariants(&mut self.state)` before returning some invariant errors, so a rejected step can still mutate live state."],"steps":[{"description":"Reviewed the latest save-migration approval notes and rechecked the touched save-schema files to determine whether any new fixes were actually requested.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply additional save-schema code edits for new review findings.","order":2,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Reran focused validation for the save/load migration path and `tank_core` test-target clippy after confirming no further code changes were warranted.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`git diff --stat -- crates/tank_core/src/save.rs crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs` returned no changes, confirming this apply-fixes pass was a no-op on the save-schema files.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test save_load` passed: 18 tests passed, 0 failed.","`cargo clippy -p tank_core --tests -- -D warnings` passed with no warnings."]}